-80d2-8d7b4daa7976" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319146 1074 "Our task is to find $A,$ $B,$ and $C$ such that\n\n$$\n\\frac{5{x}^{2}+10x-21}{(x-1)(x+2)(2x-3)}=\\frac{A}{x-1}+\\frac{B}{x+2}+\\frac{C}{2x-3}.\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides by $(x-1)(x+2)(2x-3)$ gives\n\n$$\n5{x}^{2}+10x-21=A(x+2)(2x-3)+B(x-1)(2x-3)+C(x-1)(x+2).\n$$\n\nFor $x=1,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(1)^{2}+10(1)-21 & =A(1+2)(2(1)-3)+B(1-1)(2(1)-3)+C(1-1)(1+2) \\\\ -6 & =-3A \\\\ A & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=-2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5(-2)^{2}+10(-2)-21 & =A(-2+2)(2(-2)-3)+B(-2-1)(2(-2)-3)+C(-2-1)(-2+2) \\\\ -21 & =21B \\\\ B & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $x=\\frac{3}{2}$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}+10(\\frac{3}{2})-21 & =A(\\frac{3}{2}+2)(2(\\frac{3}{2})-3)+B(\\frac{3}{2}-1)(2(\\frac{3}{2})-3)+C(\\frac{3}{2}-1)(\\frac{3}{2}+2) \\\\ \\frac{21}{4} & =\\frac{7}{4}C \\\\ C & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{5{x}^{2}+10x-21}{(x-1)(x+2)(2x-3)}=\\frac{2}{x-1}-\\frac{1}{x+2}+\\frac{3}{2x-3}.\n$$" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318607 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318650 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1069 "q-346806" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1071 "Express $\\frac{x+3}{(x+2)^{2}}$ as a sum of partial fractions.\n\n| $\\frac{x+3}{(x+2)^{2}}=$ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $x+2$ |  | $(x+2)^{2}$ |" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1072 #uuid "1bdb9225-c785-5e1d-bb71-d48854521dc2" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319147 1074 "Our task is to find $A$ and $B$ such that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x+3}{(x+2)^{2}}=\\frac{A}{x+2}+\\frac{B}{(x+2)^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying both sides of the above equality by $(x+2)^{2}$ gives\n\n$$\nx+3=A(x+2