ue] [17592186319281 1071 "What is the value of $g(t)=[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{t+8} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1) \\\\ 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}]$ at $t=\\pi ?$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $g(\\pi )=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319281 1072 #uuid "95358d96-bc3e-557b-8195-24edcb403186" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319281 1074 "To evaluate, we substitute $t=\\pi $ into our function, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g(\\pi ) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\pi +8} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\pi +1) \\\\ 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi )\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\pi +8} \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\pi +1) \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318619 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318701 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318908 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1069 "q-348653" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1071 "What is the value of $h(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{3}^{t} \\\\ {t}^{2}-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)\\end{aligned}]$ at $t=0?$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $h(0)=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1072 #uuid "212754f7-b2fa-5438-ae71-d8a476b8a715" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319282 1074 "To evaluate, we substitute $t=0$ into our function, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}h(0) & =[\\begin{aligned}{3}^{0} \\\\ {0}^{2}-1 \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533419 17592186045585 true] [17592186319283 1068 #edb/ref 17592186318964 13194139533419 175